{"seq":3,"slug":"journalism","title":"新闻传播学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism","introMarkdown":"# 新闻传播学 简介\n\n新闻传播学探讨信息如何被生产、传递、接收和理解的全过程，是一门与公共生活和民主治理密切相关的社会科学。从报纸时代的新闻伦理到社交媒体时代的算法推荐，这一学科始终在回应一个根本问题：在纷繁复杂的信息环境中，真实、准确和有意义的信息如何到达需要它的人手中。\n\n自学者进入这一领域时会发现，新闻传播学兼具理论思辨和实践操作两个面向。理论层面涉及大众传播的社会效果、媒介对认知框架的塑造、公共舆论的形成机制等深层问题；实践层面则包括新闻采写编评的基本功、数据新闻的技术能力以及危机公关的策略制定。两者相辅相成，纯粹的理论缺乏现实感，纯粹的技能则缺少反思的深度。\n\n第一章**新闻学理论**从新闻价值判断和媒体伦理出发，讨论新闻自由、公正报道和调查性新闻的核心原则，帮助建立对新闻职业的基本认知。第二章**传播学理论**引入大众传播、人际传播和文化研究的经典框架，提供分析信息传播现象的理论工具。第三章**数字媒体**聚焦社交平台、数据新闻和媒体融合等当代议题，探讨技术变革如何重塑新闻生产和信息消费的基本逻辑。第四章**公共关系**从策略制定、危机沟通和品牌传播三个维度展开，分析组织如何在公共话语空间中建立和维护自身的声誉。\n\n建议在学习理论知识的同时，养成每天分析新闻报道的习惯——不是作为读者消费信息，而是作为分析者拆解信息的生产过程、叙事策略和传播效果。这种日常训练比任何教材都更能培养敏锐的媒介素养。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"journalism-theory","title":"新闻学理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/journalism-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"news-values-principles","title":"新闻价值与原则","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/journalism-theory/news-values-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"media-ethics","title":"媒体伦理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/journalism-theory/media-ethics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"investigative-journalism","title":"调查新闻","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/journalism-theory/investigative-journalism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"communication-theory","title":"传播学理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/communication-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mass-communication","title":"大众传播","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/communication-theory/mass-communication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interpersonal-communication","title":"人际传播","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/communication-theory/interpersonal-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cultural-studies","title":"文化研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/communication-theory/cultural-studies"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-media","title":"数字媒体","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/digital-media","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-media-platforms","title":"社交媒体平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/digital-media/social-media-platforms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-journalism","title":"数据新闻","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/digital-media/data-journalism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"convergence-media","title":"融合媒体","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/digital-media/convergence-media"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"public-relations","title":"公共关系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/public-relations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pr-strategy","title":"公关策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/public-relations/pr-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crisis-communication","title":"危机传播","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/public-relations/crisis-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"brand-communication","title":"品牌传播","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/journalism/public-relations/brand-communication"}]}]}